    <strong>Exercise science career options in India split into six real tracks — strength and conditioning coaching, sports biomechanics, exercise physiology, sports performance analytics, gym and fitness-industry roles, and corporate wellness — each with a different entry route, employer type, and pay ceiling.</strong>
    This is not physiotherapy and not general fitness training; it is the science of improving performance in an already-functioning body.
